1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,340
So here's something you can do before the sun goes down today

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:05,860
Call the friend who's gone too quiet for the things they didn't say

3
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:09,700
Help somebody move a couch, or give somebody a ride

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:13,540
Pay for the car behind you, then just smile and drive

5
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:17,140
You don't need a lot of money, and you don't need a plan

6
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:20,740
Just pick up when it rings, and be the one to lend a hand
